---
// "Sur le terrain" — text-mask reveal (Heritage §7.11) with a code-drawn field.
---
<section class="reveal" id="terrain" aria-label="Sur le terrain">
  <div class="reveal__pin" data-reveal-mask>
    <div class="reveal__stage">
      <div class="reveal__field" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="reveal__scan"></div>
      </div>
      <svg class="reveal__svg" viewBox="0 0 1600 900" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">
        <defs>
          <mask id="terrainMask">
            <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="white" />
            <text x="50%" y="45%" text-anchor="middle" class="reveal__t" fill="black" font-size="300">SUR LE</text>
            <text x="50%" y="72%" text-anchor="middle" class="reveal__t" fill="black" font-size="300">TERRAIN</text>
          </mask>
        </defs>
        <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="#fdfaf2" fill-opacity="0.96" mask="url(#terrainMask)" />
      </svg>
    </div>

    <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--ink reveal__eyebrow">L’humain au cœur du métier</span>
    <h2 class="reveal__plain title title--white">Sur le <span class="title__accent">terrain</span><span class="title__dot">.</span></h2>
    <span class="reveal__tagline">Des installateurs, pas des commerciaux</span>
    <p class="reveal__caption" id="reveal-caption">Chez SecureNet</p>
    <div class="reveal__scrollhint">Faites défiler pour découvrir</div>
  </div>
</section>
